# Raw Zenodo API cache. It is ~16 MB of JSON whose per-record `stats`
# (views/downloads) change on every fetch, so committing it would make every
# weekly refresh touch all pages. The fixtures under tests/fixtures/ are the
# committed, offline subset. See README.md, "What is committed".
data/snapshot/

